{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">一、官方网站<span style=\"color: #0080ff;\">（推荐）</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤1/4：</strong>【进入官网】</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">使用电脑端的浏览器访问京东物流官网（www.jdl.com）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1753083254468.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤2/4：</strong>【找到寄件入口&amp;登录京东账号】</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">点击顶部菜单栏&ldquo;服务支持-寄件服务-批量下单&rdquo;进入页面，目前支持批量寄的有：寄快递、寄重货、寄生鲜。根据提示登录账号（如果已登录可忽略此步骤）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1753083559750.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656429073.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤3/4：</strong>【填写寄件信息】</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">进入页面填写所有必填项，通过&ldquo;上传Excel模板&rdquo;或&ldquo;添加收件人&rdquo;填写收件人信息。</span><span style=\"color: #0080ff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">（提示：使用&ldquo;上传Excel模板&rdquo;前，请先下载模板，在本地编辑完成后再点击上传。）</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656434176.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤4/4：</strong>【提交订单】</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">检查已填写的信息，确认无误后点击提交订单，提示下单成功就OK啦。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656438695.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656445904.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">二、微信小程序</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤1/3：</strong>打开微信，搜索&ldquo;京东快递&rdquo;，找到京东快递小程序。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656316223.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤2/3：</strong>打开小程序，找到&ldquo;批量寄&rdquo;。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656321171.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤3/3：</strong>进入页面填写所有必填项，通过&ldquo;批量识别&rdquo;或&ldquo;添加收件人&rdquo;填写收件人信息，核对无误后点击下单。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656339571.jpg\" /></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752658335607.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">三、京东快递APP</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤1/3：</strong>通过应用商店下载&ldquo;京东快递&rdquo;APP，如果已安装APP可忽略此步骤。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752655898773.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤2/3：</strong>打开&ldquo;京东快递&rdquo;APP，登录账号，找到&ldquo;批量寄&rdquo;点击进入。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656267644.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>○ 步骤3/3：</strong>进入页面填写所有必填项，通过&ldquo;批量识别&rdquo;或&ldquo;添加收件人&rdquo;填写收件人信息，核对无误后点击下单。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656276547.jpg\" /><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752658363027.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "批量寄件功能指引", "contentCode": "content02820", "contentTitle": "2025京东快递如何批量寄件", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1752653477000, "id": 6298, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1752656450959.png", "updateTime": 1753083587000}}